"for those who are deaf or hard of hearing. The Caption effect can even "
"animate the text fading in/out, and supports any font, size, color, and "
"margin. OpenShot also has an easy-to-use Caption editor, where you can "
"quickly insert captions at the playhead position, or edit all your caption "
"text in one place."
