"skrive med en gang. Oppdateringer av tekst vises i forhåndsvisning mens du "
"skriver."

# Main-window terminology review, 2026-09-26.
#: ../effects.rst:686
msgid ""
"To set a caption's end time from the playhead, remove the existing end "
"timestamp from the cue line, leaving the start timestamp and arrow. Move the"
" playhead to the desired end time, place the text cursor on that incomplete "
"timestamp line, and press the plus icon again. OpenShot inserts the current "
"playhead timestamp as the cue's end time."
