"correction** (white balance, exposure, contrast) and **color grading** "
"(building a stylized look). Right-click a clip and use :guilabel:`Look → "
"Color` presets to apply it instantly, or switch to :guilabel:`View → Color "
"View` for a dedicated grading workspace."
