"sfæren. **Hemisphere (1):** rettlinjet utgang over en halvsfære. **Fisheye: "
"Equidistant (2)**, **Equisolid (3)**, **Stereographic (4)**, **Orthographic "
"(5)**: sirkulær fisheye-utgang med valgt kartlegging."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1618
msgid "input_model"
msgstr "inngangsmodell"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1618
msgid ""
"``(int)`` Source lens model: **Equirectangular (0)**, **Fisheye: Equidistant"
" (1)**, **Fisheye: Equisolid (2)**, **Fisheye: Stereographic (3)**, "
"**Fisheye: Orthographic (4)**."
msgstr ""
"``(int)`` Kildelinsemodell: **Equirectangular (0)**, **Fisheye: Equidistant "
"(1)**, **Fisheye: Equisolid (2)**, **Fisheye: Stereographic (3)**, "
"**Fisheye: Orthographic (4)**."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1621
msgid ""
"``(int)`` Flip the view by 180° without mirroring. **Normal (0)**, **Invert "
"(1)**. For equirect sources this behaves like a 180° yaw. For fisheye inputs"
" it swaps front/back hemispheres."
msgstr ""
"``(int)`` Snu visningen 180° uten speiling. **Normal (0)**, **Invert (1)**. "
"For equirect-kilder oppfører dette seg som en 180° yaw. For fisheye-"
"innganger bytter det front/bak-halvkuler."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1624
msgid "interpolation"
msgstr "interpolering"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1624
msgid ""
"``(int)`` Sampling method: **Nearest (0)**, **Bilinear (1)**, **Bicubic "
"(2)**, **Auto (3)**. Auto picks Bilinear at ~1:1, Bicubic when upscaling, "
"and a mipmapped Bilinear when downscaling."
msgstr ""
"``(int)`` Samplingmetode: **Nearest (0)**, **Bilinear (1)**, **Bicubic "
"(2)**, **Auto (3)**. Auto velger Bilinear ved ~1:1, Bicubic ved "
"oppskalering, og mipmappet Bilinear ved nedskalering."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1631
msgid ""
"**Flatten a fisheye clip to a normal view:** Set **Input Model** to the "
"correct fisheye type, set **In FOV** to your lens coverage (often 180), "
"choose **Projection Mode = Sphere** or **Hemisphere**, then frame with "
"**Yaw/Pitch/Roll** and **Out FOV**."
msgstr ""
"**Flat ut et fisheye-klipp til normal visning:** Sett **Input Model** til "
"riktig fisheye-type, sett **In FOV** til din linsedekning (ofte 180), velg "
"**Projection Mode = Sphere** eller **Hemisphere**, og ram inn med "
"**Yaw/Pitch/Roll** og **Out FOV**."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1633
msgid ""
"**Reframe an equirect clip:** Set **Input Model = Equirectangular**, pick "
"**Sphere** (full) or **Hemisphere** (front/back). **Invert** on equirect is "
"equivalent to yaw +180 and does not mirror."
msgstr ""
"**Rammer inn et equirect-klipp på nytt:** Sett **Input Model = "
"Equirectangular**, velg **Sphere** (full) eller **Hemisphere** (foran/bak). "
"**Invert** på equirect tilsvarer yaw +180 og speiler ikke."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1635
msgid ""
"**Create a fisheye output:** Choose one of the **Fisheye** projection modes "
"(2..5). **Out FOV** controls disk coverage (180 gives a classic circular "
"fisheye)."
msgstr ""
"**Lag en fisheye-utgang:** Velg en av **Fisheye** projeksjonsmodusene "
"(2..5). **Out FOV** styrer diskdekningen (180 gir klassisk sirkulær "
"fisheye)."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1637
msgid ""
"If the image looks mirrored, turn **Invert** off. If you need the back view "
"on equirect, use **Invert** or add +180 to **Yaw**."
msgstr ""
"Hvis bildet ser speilet ut, slå av **Invert**. Hvis du trenger bakvisning på"
" equirect, bruk **Invert** eller legg til +180 på **Yaw**."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1638
msgid ""
"If the output looks soft or aliased, reduce **Out FOV** or increase export "
"resolution. **Auto** interpolation adapts the filter to scaling."
msgstr ""
"Hvis utgangen ser myk eller aliasert ut, reduser **Out FOV** eller øk "
"eksportoppløsningen. **Auto** interpolering tilpasser filteret til "
"skalering."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1642
msgid ""
"The Stabilizer effect reduces unwanted shake and jitter in handheld or "
"unstable video footage, resulting in smoother, more professional-looking "
"shots. This is particularly useful for action scenes, handheld shots, or any"
" footage where a tripod was not used."
msgstr ""
"Stabilizer-effekten reduserer uønsket risting og jitter i håndholdt eller "
"ustabilt videomateriale, noe som gir jevnere og mer profesjonelle opptak. "
"Dette er spesielt nyttig for actionscener, håndholdte opptak eller opptak "
"uten bruk av stativ."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1652
msgid "zoom"
msgstr "zoom"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1652
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 2)`` Percentage to zoom into the clip, to crop off the "
"shaking and uneven edges"
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 til 2)`` Prosentandel for å zoome inn i klippet, for å beskjære "
"risting og ujevne kanter"

#: ../effects.rst:1657
msgid ""
"The Timer effect renders a styled time overlay on top of a clip. It can "
"count up, count down, display a wall-clock style timer, show timecode, or "
"show frame numbers. Use it for sports clips, tutorials, races, countdowns, "
"progress timers, timecode burn-ins, or any clip that needs an on-screen "
"timer."
msgstr ""
"Timer-effekten viser en stilisert tidsvisning over et klipp. Den kan telle "
"opp, telle ned, vise en veggklokke-stil timer, vise timecode eller vise "
"rammetall. Bruk den for sportsopptak, veiledninger, løp, nedtellinger, "
"fremdriftstimere, timecode-brenninger eller ethvert klipp som trenger en "
"tidtaker på skjermen."

#: ../effects.rst:1661
msgid ""
"By default, Timer uses :guilabel:`Source Time`, so speed changes and time "
"keyframes on the parent clip also affect the timer. For example, if a clip "
"is slowed down, the timer slows down with it. Switch to :guilabel:`Clip "
"Time` when you want the timer to follow the clip's timeline position "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Som standard bruker Timer :guilabel:`Source Time`, så hastighetsendringer og"
" tidsnøkkelbilder på overordnet klipp påvirker også tidtakeren. For "
"eksempel, hvis et klipp spilles av saktere, vil tidtakeren også gå saktere. "
"Bytt til :guilabel:`Clip Time` når du vil at tidtakeren skal følge klippets "
"tidslinje i stedet."

#: ../effects.rst:1665
msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`Font Name`, :guilabel:`Font Size`, text color, stroke, and "
"background controls to style the timer. Use :guilabel:`Gravity` to choose "
"the starting position, then adjust :guilabel:`X Offset (%)` and :guilabel:`Y"
" Offset (%)` to fine-tune the placement."
msgstr ""
"Bruk :guilabel:`Font Name`, :guilabel:`Font Size`, tekstfarge, strek og "
"bakgrunnskontroller for å style tidtakeren. Bruk :guilabel:`Gravity` for å "
"velge startposisjon, og juster deretter :guilabel:`X Offset (%)` og "
":guilabel:`Y Offset (%)` for å finjustere plasseringen."

#: ../effects.rst:1669
msgid ":guilabel:`Mode` controls what kind of timer is displayed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Mode` styrer hvilken type tidtaker som vises."

#: ../effects.rst:1670
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Countdown Duration` controls count-down length. Set it to ``0`` "
"to count down from the clip's duration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Countdown Duration` styrer nedtellingens lengde. Sett den til "
"``0`` for å telle ned fra klippets varighet."

#: ../effects.rst:1671
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start Time` offsets count-up, clock, timecode, frame, and count-"
"down values."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Start Time` forskyver verdiene for opptelling, klokke, timecode, "
"ramme og nedtelling."

#: ../effects.rst:1672
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gravity` places the timer in one of nine positions on the frame."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gravity` plasserer tidtakeren i en av ni posisjoner på rammen."

#: ../effects.rst:1673
msgid ""
":guilabel:`X Offset (%)` and :guilabel:`Y Offset (%)` move the timer by a "
"percentage of the frame size."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`X Offset (%)` og :guilabel:`Y Offset (%)` flytter tidtakeren med "
"en prosentandel av rammestørrelsen."

#: ../effects.rst:1674
msgid ""
"Font, color, stroke, background, and opacity controls can be keyframed for "
"animated timer styles."
msgstr ""
"Skrift, farge, strek, bakgrunn og opasitetskontroller kan nøkkelbildes for "
"animerte tidtakerstiler."

#: ../effects.rst:1682
msgid "``(color)`` Background box color behind the timer text."
msgstr "``(color)`` Bakgrunnsboksens farge bak tidtakerteksten."

#: ../effects.rst:1683
msgid "``(float, 0 to 1)`` Background opacity."
msgstr "``(float, 0 til 1)`` Bakgrunnens opasitet."

#: ../effects.rst:1684
msgid "``(float, 0 to 100)`` Background corner radius."
msgstr "``(float, 0 til 100)`` Bakgrunnens hjørneradius."

#: ../effects.rst:1685
msgid "``(float, 0 to 100)`` Padding around the timer text."
msgstr "``(float, 0 til 100)`` Polstring rundt tidtakerteksten."

#: ../effects.rst:1686
msgid "clamp"
msgstr "begrens"

#: ../effects.rst:1686
msgid ""
"``(int, choices: ['Yes', 'No'])`` Clamp duration-style timer output at zero."
msgstr ""
"``(int, valg: ['Yes', 'No'])`` Begrens varighetsbasert tidtakerutgang til "
"null."

#: ../effects.rst:1687
msgid "``(color)`` Timer text color."
msgstr "``(color)`` Farge på tidtakerteksten."

#: ../effects.rst:1688
msgid "end_time"
msgstr "sluttid"

#: ../effects.rst:1688
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 86400)`` Countdown duration in seconds. Use ``0`` to count "
"down from the clip duration."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 til 86400)`` Nedtellingsvarighet i sekunder. Bruk ``0`` for å "
"telle ned fra klippets varighet."

#: ../effects.rst:1689
msgid "``(float, 0 to 1)`` Timer text and stroke opacity."
msgstr "``(float, 0 til 1)`` Opasitet for tidtakertekst og strek."

#: ../effects.rst:1690
msgid "font_name"
msgstr "skriftnavn"

#: ../effects.rst:1690
msgid "``(font)`` Font name or family name."
